 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2003-reserva-3-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "En la figura adjunta puedes ver representada parte de la gráfica de una función \\(f\\) que está definida en el intervalo \\((-3,3)\\) y que es simétrica respecto al origen de coordenadas.<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 260' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='150.0,98.6 168.6,98.6 187.1,98.6' fill='none' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='187.1,67.1 224.3,51.4 261.4,35.7' fill='none' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='150.0' cy='98.6' r='3.5' fill='white' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle cx='187.1' cy='98.6' r='3.5' fill='#334155'/><circle cx='187.1' cy='67.1' r='3.5' fill='white' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle cx='261.4' cy='35.7' r='3.5' fill='white' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='1.6'/><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 130.0H294.0M150.0 254.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='38.6' y1='127.0' x2='38.6' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='35.6' y='144.0' font-size='10'>-3</text><line x1='75.7' y1='127.0' x2='75.7' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='72.7' y='144.0' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='112.9' y1='127.0' x2='112.9' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='109.9' y='144.0' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='187.1' y1='127.0' x2='187.1' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='184.1' y='144.0' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='224.3' y1='127.0' x2='224.3' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='221.3' y='144.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='261.4' y1='127.0' x2='261.4' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='258.4' y='144.0' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='147.0' y1='224.3' x2='153.0' y2='224.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='228.3' font-size='10'>-3</text><line x1='147.0' y1='192.9' x2='153.0' y2='192.9' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='196.9' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='147.0' y1='161.4' x2='153.0' y2='161.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='165.4' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='147.0' y1='98.6' x2='153.0' y2='98.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='102.6' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='147.0' y1='67.1' x2='153.0' y2='67.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='71.1' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='147.0' y1='35.7' x2='153.0' y2='35.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='39.7' font-size='10'>3</text></svg></div>",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Razona cuál debe ser el valor de \\(f(0)\\).",
     "(0,75 p.) Completa la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
     "(1 p.) Halla \\(f'(x)\\) para los \\(x\\in(-3,3)\\) en los que dicha derivada exista."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Simétrica respecto del origen significa \\(f(-x)=-f(x)\\) para todo \\(x\\) (función impar). Con \\(x=0\\): \\(f(0)=-f(0)\\iff2f(0)=0\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(f(0)=0\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Del dibujo: \\(f(x)=1\\) en \\((0,1]\\) y, en \\((1,3)\\), el segmento de \\((1,2)\\) a \\((3,3)\\): \\(f(x)=\\frac{x+3}2\\). Para \\(x\\lt0\\) uso \\(f(x)=-f(-x)\\):</p>\\[f(x)=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{x-3}2&-3\\lt x\\lt-1\\\\[1mm]-1&-1\\leq x\\lt0\\\\0&x=0\\\\1&0\\lt x\\leq1\\\\[1mm]\\dfrac{x+3}2&1\\lt x\\lt3\\end{cases}\\]<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 260' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='150.0,98.6 168.6,98.6 187.1,98.6' fill='none' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='187.1,67.1 224.3,51.4 261.4,35.7' fill='none' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='150.0' cy='98.6' r='3.5' fill='white' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle cx='187.1' cy='98.6' r='3.5' fill='#334155'/><circle cx='187.1' cy='67.1' r='3.5' fill='white' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle cx='261.4' cy='35.7' r='3.5' fill='white' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='1.6'/><polyline points='112.9,161.4 131.4,161.4 150.0,161.4' fill='none' stroke='#e11d48' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='38.6,224.3 75.7,208.6 112.9,192.9' fill='none' stroke='#e11d48' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='150.0' cy='161.4' r='3.5' fill='white' stroke='#e11d48' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle cx='112.9' cy='161.4' r='3.5' fill='#e11d48'/><circle cx='112.9' cy='192.9' r='3.5' fill='white' stroke='#e11d48' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle cx='38.6' cy='224.3' r='3.5' fill='white' stroke='#e11d48' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle cx='150.0' cy='130.0' r='3.5' fill='#e11d48'/><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 130.0H294.0M150.0 254.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='38.6' y1='127.0' x2='38.6' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='35.6' y='144.0' font-size='10'>-3</text><line x1='75.7' y1='127.0' x2='75.7' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='72.7' y='144.0' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='112.9' y1='127.0' x2='112.9' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='109.9' y='144.0' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='187.1' y1='127.0' x2='187.1' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='184.1' y='144.0' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='224.3' y1='127.0' x2='224.3' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='221.3' y='144.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='261.4' y1='127.0' x2='261.4' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='258.4' y='144.0' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='147.0' y1='224.3' x2='153.0' y2='224.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='228.3' font-size='10'>-3</text><line x1='147.0' y1='192.9' x2='153.0' y2='192.9' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='196.9' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='147.0' y1='161.4' x2='153.0' y2='161.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='165.4' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='147.0' y1='98.6' x2='153.0' y2='98.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='102.6' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='147.0' y1='67.1' x2='153.0' y2='67.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='71.1' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='147.0' y1='35.7' x2='153.0' y2='35.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='39.7' font-size='10'>3</text></svg></div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) no es continua en \\(x=-1\\), \\(x=0\\) ni \\(x=1\\) (hay saltos): ahí no es derivable. En el resto, derivando cada trozo:</p><div class='res'>\\(f'(x)=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac12&\\text{si }x\\in(-3,-1)\\cup(1,3)\\\\[1mm]0&\\text{si }x\\in(-1,0)\\cup(0,1)\\end{cases}\\); no existe en \\(x=-1,0,1\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "rep",
