   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La superficie de abajo está entre la parábola y el eje, de \\(x=1\\) a \\(x=m\\); la de arriba, entre la parábola e \\(y=1\\), de \\(x=m\\) a \\(x=2\\):</p>\\[\\int_1^m\\frac{x^2}4dx=\\frac{m^3-1}{12},\\qquad\\int_m^2\\left(1-\\frac{x^2}4\\right)dx=(2-m)-\\frac{8-m^3}{12}\\]<p>Igualando: \\(\\frac{m^3}{12}-\\frac1{12}=2-m-\\frac23+\\frac{m^3}{12}\\iff m=2-\\frac23+\\frac1{12}=\\frac{17}{12}\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 170' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='144.8,113.6 146.2,112.9 147.7,112.2 149.1,111.5 150.6,110.7 152.0,110.0 153.5,109.3 154.9,108.5 156.4,107.8 157.8,107.0 159.2,106.2 160.7,105.5 162.1,104.7 163.6,103.9 165.0,103.1 166.5,102.2 167.9,101.4 169.4,100.6 170.8,99.7 172.2,98.9 173.7,98.0 175.1,97.1 176.6,96.2 178.0,95.3 179.5,94.4 180.9,93.5 182.4,92.6 183.8,91.6 185.2,90.7 186.7,89.7 188.1,88.8 188.1,138.2 186.7,138.2 185.2,138.2 183.8,138.2 182.4,138.2 180.9,138.2 179.5,138.2 178.0,138.2 176.6,138.2 175.1,138.2 173.7,138.2 172.2,138.2 170.8,138.2 169.4,138.2 167.9,138.2 166.5,138.2 165.0,138.2 163.6,138.2 162.1,138.2 160.7,138.2 159.2,138.2 157.8,138.2 156.4,138.2 154.9,138.2 153.5,138.2 152.0,138.2 150.6,138.2 149.1,138.2 147.7,138.2 146.2,138.2 144.8,138.2' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polygon points='188.1,39.7 190.2,39.7 192.2,39.7 194.2,39.7 196.2,39.7 198.2,39.7 200.3,39.7 202.3,39.7 204.3,39.7 206.3,39.7 208.4,39.7 210.4,39.7 212.4,39.7 214.4,39.7 216.4,39.7 218.5,39.7 220.5,39.7 222.5,39.7 224.5,39.7 226.6,39.7 228.6,39.7 230.6,39.7 232.6,39.7 234.6,39.7 236.7,39.7 238.7,39.7 240.7,39.7 242.7,39.7 244.8,39.7 246.8,39.7 248.8,39.7 248.8,39.7 246.8,41.6 244.8,43.5 242.7,45.4 240.7,47.2 238.7,49.0 236.7,50.9 234.6,52.6 232.6,54.4 230.6,56.2 228.6,57.9 226.6,59.6 224.5,61.3 222.5,63.0 220.5,64.7 218.5,66.3 216.4,68.0 214.4,69.6 212.4,71.2 210.4,72.7 208.4,74.3 206.3,75.8 204.3,77.3 202.3,78